### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7053
@contentType = application/json

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### API Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status

### Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### Get current user (requires authentication)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get current user info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Validate token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get all tours (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tours

### Get featured tours (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tours/featured

### Get user's tours (protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tours/my-tours
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Delete a tour (protected) - This should return 401/403 or work if user has permissions
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tours/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Test without authentication (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tours/my-tours